The strairs to Vlad are in a special Lethe level. (called "peacefull  
valley")
I just wizmoded it. The stairs from upper level should be in the top left  
corner, the top middle-right consist in 4 small rooms, and left  
middle-bottom has 5 corridor-room.
The bottom-left corner (other side from the Lethe) has a building with a  
huge throne room (left), two rooms (the bottom one containing the  
downstairs) and another room to the right with stairs to Vlad.
Downstairs as well as stairs to Vlad are behind secret doors.

In that game, Lethe gorge is between 44-52 (Castle at 46), Gehennom starts  
at 53 and strais to Vlad are at 58.

